{"work_id":"tirumbippaar","target_language":"en","canonical_scene":83,"scene_status":"verified","unit_count":12,"units":[{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u001","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":100,"printed_page":92}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Chennai hotel. Paranthaman is writing.)"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u002","kind":"written-text","status":"verified","source":{"speaker_label":null,"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":100,"printed_page":92},{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"URGENT APPEAL. To dear Kumudha! I am longing to see you. Forget what has happened and let me know your address immediately; I will run to you and meet you. Yours, your loving uncle, Paranthaman, Room 15, Himalaya Hotel, Chennai.","notes":["The printed appeal genuinely crosses PDF 100→101. It is source-visible written text, so no dialogue speaker or dialogue-record ID is invented."]}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u003","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(He reads through the letter he has written once, then turns to the boy.)"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u004","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d001","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"You must go immediately to the offices of the daily newspapers."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u005","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d002","speaker_label":"பையன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Why, sir..."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u006","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d003","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"This advertisement must be placed in every newspaper."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u007","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d004","speaker_label":"பையன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Why all this needless trouble? Wouldn't it be enough to send a card directly to Kumudha-amma!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u008","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d005","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Hey! The moment sense came to me, yours disappeared! If I knew Kumudha's address, why would I need this advertisement! Hmm..."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u009","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d006","speaker_label":"பையன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Oh... I forgot that."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u010","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d007","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Taking out one hundred rupees and giving it to him.) Here, pay this for the advertisement charges! Tell them it must appear in every paper today itself!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u011","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d008","speaker_label":"பையன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Taking the money and the paper.) All right!..."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s083-u012","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s083-d009","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":101,"printed_page":93}]},"translation":{"english_text":"I will certainly find out where my Kumudha is! I will run to her. I will ask forgiveness. I will bring a revival to the family that has fallen into ruin!"}}]}